334
00:25:09,940 --> 00:25:13,140
ぶっちゃけ死活問題、あなたのおかげで私のハートはボロボロです！
Frankly, it's a matter of life and death, because of you my heart is in tatters!

335
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:15,840
すれ違いいつもすれ違い
Missing each other, always missing each other.

336
00:25:15,840 --> 00:25:18,440
どっちの気持ちも言い出さないからいつも私が空回り
Since neither of us says how we feel, I'm always running in circles.

337
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:21,040
なんだかバカみたいじゃない？そう、そんなことない？楽しいの？
Isn't it kind of stupid? Is it not like that? Is it fun?

338
00:25:21,040 --> 00:25:23,540
どこか足元見てる感じで
It feels like you're looking down on me somehow,

339
00:25:23,540 --> 00:25:26,140
ラブみ冷めてる感じで
feels like our love has cooled down.

340
00:25:26,140 --> 00:25:30,540
駆け引き？やだ　こっちもケチじゃなくなーい？
Mind games? No way, isn't it stingy on my end too?

341
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:35,840
そういうめんどくさいことしてるから、めんどくさいことになるんだよ！
Doing those annoying things is why things get so annoying!

342
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:40,640
おねがいダーリン　見て聞いて　寂しさは飾りじゃないのよ
Please, Darling, look and listen. My loneliness isn't just for show.

343
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:46,340
よそ見しないで　逃げないで　触ってよ　心の奥の方
Don't look away, don't run away. Touch the depth of my heart.

344
00:25:46,340 --> 00:25:52,540
一瞬のことじゃない　おねだりしてみてはくれないの？
It's not just for a moment. Won't you try pleading with me?

345
00:26:02,040 --> 00:26:04,540
言葉にできない臆病さは
The cowardice that cannot be put into words

346
00:26:04,540 --> 00:26:07,440
したたかさではないのよ
is not calculation.

347
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:11,440
甘えてないで口に出してよ
Don't just rely on me, say it out loud.

348
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:14,540
もう、ちゃんとこっち向いてってば！
Geez, look over here already!

349
00:26:14,540 --> 00:26:19,440
おねがいダーリン　見て聞いて　欲しいのはカタチのないもの
Please, Darling, look and listen. What I want is something with no shape.

350
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:25,040
バカにしないで　見て聞いて　覗いてよ　瞳の奥の方
Don't make fun of me, look and listen. Peek into the depths of my eyes.

351
00:26:25,040 --> 00:26:30,040
甘くないダーリン　ねだらないで　暴いてよ　私の素顔
My sweet-less Darling, don't plead, uncover my true face.

352
00:26:30,040 --> 00:26:35,440
おねがいダーリン　そばにいて　触らせて　心の奥の方
Please, Darling, stay by my side, let me touch the depth of your heart.

353
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:42,540
真っ直ぐ見つめて　おねだりしてみてほしいの
Stare straight at me, I want you to try pleading with me.

354
00:26:58,040 --> 00:26:59,940
おねがいダーリン！
Please, Darling!

355
00:27:04,540 --> 00:27:07,540
いぇーい！ うおおおー！
Yay! Woooo!

356
00:27:07,540 --> 00:27:11,540
魔界の天才ヴァンパイア、ホロライブ1期生の夜空メルでーす！
The genius vampire of the demon realm, Yozora Mel from hololive 1st generation!

357
00:27:11,540 --> 00:27:17,840
えー、ホロライブ界の天才ヴァンパイア…あ、5期生の桃鈴ねねでーす！
Um, the genius vampire of the hololive world... ah, Momosuzu Nene from 5th generation!

358
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:20,540
二人合わせてー
Together we are...

359
00:27:20,540 --> 00:27:26,540
せーの、ねねメルねるねるねーす！
One, two, Nene-Mel Nelnelnes!

360
00:27:26,540 --> 00:27:29,040
完璧じゃん！ いいじゃん！ やったー！
That was perfect! That's great! Yay!

361
00:27:29,040 --> 00:27:32,040
この前のバカライブで鍛えられたの？
Did you train for this in that stupid live show earlier?

362
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:35,040
ね、すごい鍛えられてた。楽しかったねー！
Yeah, I was trained a lot. That was fun!

363
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:39,040
ってか、メル先輩、5周年！ / そうだよ、5周年だよー！
By the way, Mel-senpai, your 5th anniversary! / That's right, 5th anniversary!

364
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:41,540
すごーい！おめでとー！ / ありがとう、5周年、いぇーい！
Amazing! Congratulations! / Thank you, 5th anniversary, yay!

365
00:27:41,540 --> 00:27:45,040
え、なんか今回のロゴめっちゃ可愛い。なんかちょっとシックな感じもあって。
Oh, the logo this time is super cute. It has a slightly chic feel to it too.

366
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:48,040
そうなんだよ。ちょっとウェディングっぽい感じ。
That's right. It has a bit of a wedding-like feel.

367
00:27:48,040 --> 00:27:53,040
あ、ぽいぽいぽい！なんかお菓子みたいなイメージだね。 / そうだね、ケーキも後ろにあるしね。
Ah, yeah, yeah, yeah! It feels kind of like candy. / Right, we also have a cake behind us.

368
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:59,040
あ、ね！お城すごいね、メルちゃん、ね！ / 見えてないけど、いぇーい！
Ah, right! The castle is amazing, Mel-chan, right! / I can't see it, but yay!

369
00:28:01,040 --> 00:28:06,040
ちょっとね、これからもね、大先輩なんですけど、ちょっと... / これ何ですか、これ？
Since you're my great senpai, from now on too, um... / What is this?

370
00:28:06,040 --> 00:28:10,040
これ、ごま（胡麻）すってる、これ？ / すって、すってないです、いやでもね、これからも...
Are you brown-nosing me with this? / I-I'm not brown-nosing! But seriously, from now on too...

371
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:14,540
よろしくお願いしますよー！ / 後輩、よろしくね。
I'll be in your care! / As my kouhai, I'll count on you.

372
00:28:14,540 --> 00:28:19,040
後輩として、よろしくね。あ、ありがとうございます！よろしくね！ / うん、よろしくねー。
As your kouhai, I count on you. Ah, thank you! I'm in your care! / Yeah, I look forward to it too.

373
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:26,040
じゃあ、メル先輩、まだまだね、これからもういっぱい、やることがあると思うので。 / ありますとも！まだまだ！
So, Mel-senpai, you still have plenty of things to do from here on, I think. / I certainly do! Still plenty!

374
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:30,040
では、帰りましょうかね？ / え？帰るの？ / がんばって！がんばってね！
Shall we go home now? / Eh? Go home? / Do your best! Good luck!

375
00:28:30,040 --> 00:28:35,040
ありがとう。え、ちょ、ちょ、ちょ！待って、待って！ / おいおいおい、何々何ー？
Thank you. Eh, wait, wait, wait! Wait a minute! / Hey, hey, what is it?

376
00:28:35,040 --> 00:28:39,040
まだ帰さないよ。 / きゃっ！
I'm not letting you go home yet. / Kya!

377
00:28:45,940 --> 00:28:47,140
カプ民、起きなさいよ！
Kapu-min, wake up already!

378
00:28:47,140 --> 00:28:48,440
Teammates, wake up!

379
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:49,740
風真隊、起きてください！
Kazama-tai, please wake up!

380
00:28:49,740 --> 00:28:51,040
ロゼ隊、起きて！
Rose-tai, wake up!

381
00:28:51,040 --> 00:28:52,540
ねっ友、起きて！
Nettomo, wake up!

382
00:28:52,540 --> 00:28:55,040
喜びも
Our joys,

383
00:28:55,040 --> 00:28:57,440
悲しみも
and our sorrows,

384
00:28:57,440 --> 00:29:00,040
あなたと分け合え
let's share them with you

385
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:04,540
五等分で
divided into five parts.

386
00:29:14,340 --> 00:29:17,340
1つ、作り笑いも見破られ
One: You saw right through my fake smile,

387
00:29:17,340 --> 00:29:20,140
2つ、あんたなんか大嫌いよ
Two: I absolutely hate you,

388
00:29:20,140 --> 00:29:25,540
3つ、真っ直ぐなこの気持ち気づいて
Three: Please notice these straightforward feelings of mine,

389
00:29:25,540 --> 00:29:28,140
4つ、気がつくとだんだん
Four: Before I knew it, gradually...

390
00:29:28,140 --> 00:29:31,040
5つ、分かり合えたね
Five: We came to understand each other,

391
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:34,540
勉強だけじゃなくて
It's not just about studying,

392
00:29:34,540 --> 00:29:39,040
君を知りたいよ
I want to get to know you.

393
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:41,540
大嫌いから
From "I hate you",

394
00:29:41,540 --> 00:29:44,540
大好きへと
to "I love you",

395
00:29:44,540 --> 00:29:50,040
変わる心についていけないよ
I can't keep up with my changing heart.

396
00:29:50,040 --> 00:29:52,540
どんなことも
No matter what it is,

397
00:29:52,540 --> 00:29:55,540
あなたさえ
as long as it's with you,

398
00:29:55,540 --> 00:30:00,040
五等分です　でも私は...
it's divided into five parts. But as for me...

399
00:30:00,648 --> 00:30:01,848
私、私は
As for me, as for me...

400
00:30:01,848 --> 00:30:03,448
あなたが好きよ
I love you.

401
00:30:13,648 --> 00:30:16,448
少し複雑に心の中
A little complicated inside my heart,

402
00:30:16,448 --> 00:30:19,448
でも変わってゆく気持ち
but my feelings are changing.

403
00:30:19,448 --> 00:30:24,448
ずっとこんな関係続いていたらいいのにな
I wish this kind of relationship could last forever.

404
00:30:24,448 --> 00:30:27,448
忘れられない思い出も
Memories I can't forget,

405
00:30:27,448 --> 00:30:30,448
これから増えるストーリーも
and the stories that will increase from now on...

406
00:30:30,448 --> 00:30:33,648
あなたなしだったら
If it weren't for you,

407
00:30:33,648 --> 00:30:36,748
意味がない
there would be no point,

408
00:30:36,748 --> 00:30:38,248
だめよ
no way.

409
00:30:38,248 --> 00:30:43,748
ずっとそばで教えてね
Always stay by my side and teach me, okay?

410
00:30:43,748 --> 00:30:49,248
だけど勝手に胸の鼓動高鳴る
But my heart starts racing on its own.

411
00:30:49,248 --> 00:30:54,648
運命だって信じられる
I can even believe in destiny.

412
00:30:54,648 --> 00:30:57,248
同じ気持ちね
We feel the same, don't we?

413
00:30:57,248 --> 00:31:00,248
またいつか いつか いつか いつか
Will we dream of it again someday, someday,

414
00:31:00,248 --> 00:31:02,448
夢に見るかな
someday, someday?

415
00:31:12,448 --> 00:31:15,348
少しずつ変わる思い
My feelings are changing little by little.

416
00:31:15,348 --> 00:31:18,248
焦りや苛立ち和らいでく
My impatience and irritation are softening.

417
00:31:18,248 --> 00:31:22,448
信じきれる自信
The confidence to fully believe.

418
00:31:22,448 --> 00:31:26,248
胸の奥に隠れてる言葉
The words hidden deep inside my heart,

419
00:31:26,248 --> 00:31:29,648
甘えたいだけどいいですかって
I want to depend on you, but is that okay?

420
00:31:29,648 --> 00:31:34,548
私、付いて行くわ
I will follow you.

421
00:31:34,548 --> 00:31:37,348
いつまでも
Forever,

422
00:31:37,348 --> 00:31:40,248
忘れない
I won't forget.

423
00:31:40,248 --> 00:31:42,848
出会えた奇跡
The miracle of our meeting,

424
00:31:42,848 --> 00:31:45,648
偶然じゃない そうでしょ？
it wasn't a coincidence, right?

425
00:31:45,648 --> 00:31:50,848
大嫌いから 大好きへと
From hate to love,

426
00:31:50,848 --> 00:31:56,248
変わる心に付いて行きたいよ
I want to keep up with my changing heart.

427
00:31:56,248 --> 00:31:59,248
どんなことも
No matter what,

428
00:31:59,248 --> 00:32:01,648
あなたさえ
as long as you're here,

429
00:32:01,648 --> 00:32:04,648
克服する
we can overcome anything.

430
00:32:04,648 --> 00:32:07,448
でも私 私 私 私 私は
But as for me, me, me, me, as for me...

431
00:32:07,448 --> 00:32:10,248
ずっと ずっと ずっと ずっと あなたに
Always, always, always, always to you...

432
00:32:10,248 --> 00:32:13,448
愛を誓います
I swear my love.

433
00:32:13,448 --> 00:32:16,848
We are the bride

434
00:32:16,848 --> 00:32:20,048
We are the bride

435
00:32:20,048 --> 00:32:22,848
We are the bride, We are the bride

436
00:32:22,848 --> 00:32:25,048
Please

437
00:32:30,548 --> 00:32:35,048
いぇーい！
Yay!

438
00:32:39,048 --> 00:32:41,548
サンキュー、サンキュー！
Thank you, thank you!

439
00:32:41,548 --> 00:32:45,548
すごい！この曲、あれか！五等分の花嫁の曲だよね！
Awesome! This song is that, right? The song from The Quintessential Quintuplets!

440
00:32:45,548 --> 00:32:47,048
そうだよー！
That's right!

441
00:32:47,048 --> 00:32:51,048
どうして今日この5人が集められたか、みんな分かる？
Does everyone know why the five of us were gathered today?

442
00:32:51,048 --> 00:32:53,048
え、なんでなんで？
Eh, why, why?

443
00:32:53,048 --> 00:32:55,048
全然わかんない
I have no idea.

444
00:32:55,048 --> 00:32:56,548
わかんないー
I don't know.

445
00:32:56,548 --> 00:32:58,048
頭を見るんだ
Look at our heads.

446
00:32:58,048 --> 00:32:59,048
頭？
Our heads?

447
00:32:59,048 --> 00:33:00,048
ヘッド、ヘッド！
Heads, heads!

448
00:33:00,048 --> 00:33:01,048
頭？
Heads?

449
00:33:01,048 --> 00:33:03,048
ヘッドドレス！
Head dresses!

450
00:33:03,048 --> 00:33:04,048
あー！
Ah!

451
00:33:04,048 --> 00:33:06,548
ヘッドドレスだ！
It's head dresses!

452
00:33:06,548 --> 00:33:10,048
そう、この5人、ヘッドドレスがお揃いだから、歌いたかったんだ
Right! Since we all have matching head dresses, I wanted us to sing together.

453
00:33:10,048 --> 00:33:12,548
おおー！うれしい！
Oooh! I'm so glad!

454
00:33:13,548 --> 00:33:15,048
ということはさ、でも、この曲だと
Which means... but, with this song,

455
00:33:15,048 --> 00:33:19,548
私たちの中から1人選んでもらわなきゃいけないんじゃないの？
doesn't he have to choose one of us?

456
00:33:19,548 --> 00:33:20,548
え、うそ！
Wait, really?!

457
00:33:20,548 --> 00:33:22,048
アピールしなきゃ！
We have to show off!

458
00:33:22,048 --> 00:33:23,048
選んで！
Choose me!

459
00:33:23,048 --> 00:33:24,048
選んで！
Choose me!

460
00:33:24,048 --> 00:33:27,548
ちょっとちょっと！待って待って待って！
Wait, wait, wait, wait!

461
00:33:27,548 --> 00:33:29,548
今日は5周年なんだから<
Today is my 5th anniversary,

462
00:33:29,548 --> 00:33:31,548
メルの特権！
so Mel has special privilege!

463
00:33:31,548 --> 00:33:34,548
メルが選ばれるってこと！
Mel gets to be chosen!

464
00:33:34,548 --> 00:33:36,548
えー！
What?!

465
00:33:36,548 --> 00:33:37,548
ずるい！
No fair!

466
00:33:37,548 --> 00:33:39,048
選ばせて！
Let us be chosen!

467
00:33:39,048 --> 00:33:41,048
いいよ、いいよ
Fine, fine.

468
00:33:41,048 --> 00:33:42,548
おめでとう！
Congratulations!

469
00:33:42,548 --> 00:33:44,048
じゃあ、おめでとう！
Well then, congratulations!

470
00:33:44,048 --> 00:33:47,048
いぇーい！
Yay!

471
00:33:56,048 --> 00:33:59,848
おまたせ！遅くなってごめんね
Sorry to keep you waiting! Sorry I'm late.

472
00:34:00,048 --> 00:34:03,548
大丈夫だよ！今日はなにしてたの？
It's okay! What were you doing today?

473
00:34:03,548 --> 00:34:07,548
今日はね！ちょこ先生とねねちと〜
Today, you see! I was with Choco-sensei and Nenechi...

474
00:34:07,548 --> 00:34:11,548
ってことがあってさ！めっちゃ楽しかったよ！
...and that happened! It was super fun!

475
00:34:11,548 --> 00:34:16,848
(楽しそうに話すメルを見て微笑ましい反面、少しもやもした感情になってしまった。)
(While it's heartwarming to see Mel talking so happily, I felt a bit conflicted.)

476
00:34:16,848 --> 00:34:21,048
(せっかく時間を作ってくれてるのにこんなんじゃダメだな)
(She made time for me, so I shouldn't be like this.)

477
00:34:21,048 --> 00:34:24,048
んー？なんかあった？
Hmm? Did something happen?

478
00:34:24,048 --> 00:34:29,048
(うまく隠してたつもりだったけどどうやら気づかれたようだ。)
(I thought I hid it well, but she noticed.)

479
00:34:29,048 --> 00:34:33,048
(なんでわかるんだろう…)
(How does she know...)

480
00:34:33,048 --> 00:34:35,548
えっな、なんで？
Eh, how...?

481
00:34:35,548 --> 00:34:41,048
そりゃあ君のことちゃんーと見てますから！わかるよ？
Well, that's because I'm always looking closely at you! Of course I'd know.

482
00:34:41,048 --> 00:34:45,548
…いや、その。僕といるときもちゃんと楽しめてるのかなって…
...No, well. I was wondering if you're really enjoying yourself when you're with me...

483
00:34:45,548 --> 00:34:51,048
もう！楽しいに決まってるでしょ！じゃなかったらこんなおしゃれして…
Geez! Of course I'm having fun! If I wasn't, I wouldn't have dressed up like this...

484
00:34:51,048 --> 00:34:55,848
一週間前からずっと楽しみになんかしてないってば！
...and I wouldn't have been looking forward to this since a week ago!

485
00:34:55,848 --> 00:35:00,048
(頬を膨らませて怒るメルを見て不謹慎だけど僕は安心した。)
(Seeing Mel pout in anger, although it's inappropriate, I felt relieved.)

486
00:35:00,056 --> 00:35:00,856
(頬を膨らませて怒るメルを見て不謹慎だけど僕は安心した。)
(Seeing Mel puff out her cheeks in anger, it was inappropriate, but I felt relieved.)

487
00:35:01,056 --> 00:35:04,456
ていうか君もそういうこと考えるんだね
I mean, you think about those kinds of things too.

488
00:35:04,856 --> 00:35:07,056
え？
Eh?

489
00:35:07,256 --> 00:35:13,156
ううん、いつもそういうの隠すからさ！  ふふ、可愛いとこあるね～
No, it's just that you always hide that side of yourself! Hehe, you have your cute moments.

490
00:35:13,556 --> 00:35:18,456
あのさ、この間ドレス着てみたいっていってたよね。本当に着てみない？
You know, you said the other day that you wanted to try wearing a dress. Do you want to actually try it on?

491
00:35:18,756 --> 00:35:20,956
えっ？！着れるの…？！！！
What?! I can wear one...?!!!

492
00:35:58,256 --> 00:36:03,056
朝になったら
When morning comes,

493
00:36:03,056 --> 00:36:09,556
二人目を合わせて
we'll look into each other's eyes,

494
00:36:10,556 --> 00:36:15,556
たわいないこと
and about silly things,

495
00:36:15,556 --> 00:36:21,756
少し話したいな
I want to talk a little.

496
00:36:23,556 --> 00:36:28,056
晴れた午後は
On a sunny afternoon,

497
00:36:28,056 --> 00:36:34,556
そっと手をつないで
let's gently hold hands,

498
00:36:36,556 --> 00:36:41,556
穏やかな街を
and through the peaceful town,

499
00:36:41,556 --> 00:36:47,556
少し歩いてみたり
maybe take a short walk.

500
00:36:48,556 --> 00:36:54,056
そんな想像さえ
Even a simple daydream like that

501
00:36:54,556 --> 00:37:00,556
愛おしくて
is so precious to me,

502
00:37:02,056 --> 00:37:08,056
いつまでも同じ時間を
wishing we could always

503
00:37:08,056 --> 00:37:15,556
一緒に過ごしていたくて
spend the same time together.

504
00:37:18,556 --> 00:37:20,556
だって
Because,

505
00:37:20,556 --> 00:37:23,556
朝も
both in the morning

506
00:37:23,556 --> 00:37:26,056
夜も
and at night,

507
00:37:26,056 --> 00:37:32,556
伝えたいことたくさんあって
there are so many things I want to tell you.

508
00:37:33,056 --> 00:37:36,056
今日も
Today,

509
00:37:36,056 --> 00:37:39,056
明日も
and tomorrow too,

510
00:37:39,056 --> 00:37:43,056
好きだなんて
if I could say "I love you"...

511
00:37:43,056 --> 00:37:48,056
言えたら
If only I could.

512
00:38:12,556 --> 00:38:17,056
夜になったら
When night falls,

513
00:38:17,056 --> 00:38:24,056
星の見える場所で
in a place where we can see the stars,

514
00:38:25,056 --> 00:38:30,056
眠りにつくまで
until we fall asleep,

515
00:38:30,056 --> 00:38:36,556
ずっと寄りそっていたいな
I want to snuggle close to you.

516
00:38:37,556 --> 00:38:43,556
触れられる距離が
This distance where we can touch

517
00:38:43,556 --> 00:38:49,056
愛おしくて
is so precious to me,

518
00:38:50,056 --> 00:38:56,556
その声をその体温を
your voice and your warmth,

519
00:38:57,056 --> 00:39:04,556
もっと感じていたくて
I want to feel them even more.

520
00:39:07,556 --> 00:39:09,556
だって
Because,

521
00:39:09,556 --> 00:39:12,556
何度も
no matter how many times

522
00:39:12,556 --> 00:39:15,056
何度も
and how many times

523
00:39:15,056 --> 00:39:21,056
名前を呼んでもまだ足りなくて
I call your name, it's never enough.

524
00:39:21,556 --> 00:39:25,056
今日も
Today,

525
00:39:25,056 --> 00:39:28,056
明日も
and tomorrow too,

526
00:39:28,056 --> 00:39:32,056
そう二人で
if the two of us can just...

527
00:39:32,056 --> 00:39:36,056
いれたら
be together like this.

528
00:39:38,056 --> 00:39:44,056
切ないときは綺麗な
When we feel sad, let's decorate with beautiful

529
00:39:44,556 --> 00:39:51,056
花を飾りましょう
flowers.

530
00:39:51,556 --> 00:39:57,056
悲しいときは楽しい
When we feel down, let's have a fun

531
00:39:57,056 --> 00:40:00,056
話しをし
conversation.

532
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:01,564
...ましょう
...let's do.

533
00:40:06,564 --> 00:40:13,564
髪に 頬に
In my hair, on my cheeks...

534
00:40:13,564 --> 00:40:19,564
ただ触ってくれるだけで
...just by you touching them...

535
00:40:20,364 --> 00:40:25,564
暗い心も
...even my dark heart...

536
00:40:25,564 --> 00:40:31,564
瞬間 明るくなるんだって
...instantly brightens up, they say.

537
00:40:32,364 --> 00:40:38,064
朝も 夜も
Whether morning or night,

538
00:40:38,064 --> 00:40:44,564
叶えたいこと こんなにあって
there are so many wishes I want to make come true.

539
00:40:45,364 --> 00:40:50,564
今日も 明日も
Today and tomorrow too,

540
00:40:50,564 --> 00:41:00,064
幸せだと言えたら
if only I could say that I am happy...

541
00:41:02,564 --> 00:41:07,564
いいのに
...that would be so nice.

542
00:41:08,564 --> 00:41:14,564
メルは あなたのこと 愛しています
Mel loves you.

543
00:41:31,564 --> 00:41:33,564
みんなー！
Everyone!

544
00:41:33,564 --> 00:41:38,064
ここまで歌ってきましたけど どうですか？
I've sung up to this point, but how was it?

545
00:41:38,064 --> 00:41:41,064
楽しんでますか？
Are you enjoying yourselves?

546
00:41:42,064 --> 00:41:44,064
ここで 恒例のね
And now, for the usual...

547
00:41:44,064 --> 00:41:50,064
みんなお待ちかね 告知タイムに行きたいと思います！
...which you've all been waiting for: announcement time!

548
00:41:50,064 --> 00:41:55,564
もう5年目になるので みんなも大体流れ分かってきたよね？きっとね！
It's my 5th year already, so you probably know how this goes, right?

549
00:41:56,564 --> 00:41:58,564
そう、正解！
Yes, exactly!

550
00:41:59,064 --> 00:42:00,564
なんと！
And...

551
00:42:00,564 --> 00:42:07,564
このあと 夜空メル5周年グッズが 販売されます！やったー！
...right after this, Yozora Mel's 5th-anniversary merchandise goes on sale! Yay!

552
00:42:08,064 --> 00:42:11,064
イェーイ！
Yay!

553
00:42:11,064 --> 00:42:14,064
まず 1つ目は
First off, the first item is...

554
00:42:14,064 --> 00:42:21,064
さとうぽて先生描き下ろし アクリルスタンド！
...a newly drawn acrylic stand by Satopote-sensei!

555
00:42:22,564 --> 00:42:29,064
なんと このアクリルスタンド ゆらゆら揺れるようになっております！
Amazingly, this acrylic stand is designed to sway back and forth!

556
00:42:29,064 --> 00:42:31,564
すごい！可愛いよ！
It's amazing and so cute!

557
00:42:31,564 --> 00:42:37,064
それからね 純白のドレス めちゃくちゃ可愛いので ぜひゲットしてください！
And that pure white dress is super cute, so please make sure to get it!

558
00:42:37,564 --> 00:42:40,564
そして 2つ目は
And the second item is...

559
00:42:41,064 --> 00:42:46,064
ミシュネ先生描き下ろしの メルと始める新生活クッション！
...the "Start a New Life with Mel" Cushion, newly drawn by Mishune-sensei!

560
00:42:46,064 --> 00:42:51,064
表裏どちらも ガチ恋距離のメルちゃんがいます！
On both sides, Mel is at a heart-throbbing distance!

561
00:42:51,064 --> 00:42:55,564
気分でお好きなように使ってください！
Please use it however you like depending on your mood!

562
00:42:56,064 --> 00:43:00,564
君の生活の一部に メルを置いてくれると嬉しいです！
I'd be so happy if you'd let Mel be a part of your daily life!

563
00:43:01,064 --> 00:43:03,064
そして 3つ目！
And thirdly!

564
00:43:03,064 --> 00:43:06,564
メルと契約ネックレスです！
The "Contract with Mel" Necklace!

565
00:43:06,564 --> 00:43:10,064
アクセサリー物は 実はメル初めてなので
This is actually my first time releasing an accessory,

566
00:43:10,064 --> 00:43:13,064
ぜひこれも着けてほしいな
so I really want you to wear it.

567
00:43:13,064 --> 00:43:20,064
男の子も女の子も着けやすいデザインに メルが監修させていただきました！
I supervised the design to make it easy to wear for both boys and girls!

568
00:43:20,064 --> 00:43:22,064
イェい！どや！
Yay! Check it out!

569
00:43:22,564 --> 00:43:25,064
これ あとね みんな気付いたかな？
Also, did everyone notice?

570
00:43:25,064 --> 00:43:29,564
今回のメインイラスト 実はね メル着けてるんだ！
Mel is actually wearing it in this main illustration!

571
00:43:29,564 --> 00:43:33,564
なので これを着ければ メルとお揃い！
So if you wear this, we'll match!

572
00:43:33,564 --> 00:43:40,064
そして メルとずっと一緒にいようねっていう契約も 結んだことになるので
And it also means you've signed a contract to be with Mel forever,

573
00:43:40,064 --> 00:43:42,564
ぜひ こちらもゲットしてください！
so please get this one too!

574
00:43:43,564 --> 00:43:48,064
そして フルセットで購入してくれた方には
And for those who purchase the full set...

575
00:43:48,064 --> 00:43:52,064
メルの直筆サインが
...you will receive a postcard...

576
00:43:52,064 --> 00:43:55,564
つくポストカードがもらえます！
...personally autographed by Mel!

577
00:43:55,564 --> 00:43:57,564
やったー！
Yay!

578
00:43:57,564 --> 00:44:00,564
複製メッセージも付いてますので
It also includes a printed message,

579
00:44:00,564 --> 00:44:06,564
こちらもね お早めに！数量限定になってるので お早めにお願いしますね！
so grab it quickly! It's limited quantity, so act fast!

580
00:44:07,064 --> 00:44:12,564
グッズはこのあと 21時から販売されます！
The merchandise will be available starting at 9:00 PM!

581
00:44:12,564 --> 00:44:18,064
心を込めて 今回もカキカキしますので よろしくお願いします！
I'll sign each one with all my heart, so please look forward to it!

582
00:44:20,064 --> 00:44:25,064
それではね 次の曲で最後になるんですが
Well then, the next song will be the last one, but...

583
00:44:25,064 --> 00:44:33,564
しかーし 今回も メンバー限定でアフターライブを開催しちゃいます！やったー！
However! We'll hold a members-only after-live this time too! Yay!

584
00:44:34,064 --> 00:44:38,064
よかったら 君も かぷ民にならないか？
If you'd like, won't you become a Kapumin too?

585
00:44:38,064 --> 00:44:44,064
なので 今のうちに メンバー登録もよろしくお願いします！
So, please join the membership in the meantime!

586
00:44:44,564 --> 00:44:48,064
あっという間のライブでしたけど
It was a concert that went by in a flash,

587
00:44:48,064 --> 00:44:54,064
5年目も もっともっと いろんな人が楽しんで メルのことを好きになってくれるよう
but in my 5th year, so more people can enjoy and come to love Mel,

588
00:44:54,064 --> 00:44:59,064
ホロライブを引っ張っていけるように 頑張りますので こんなメルを...
I'll do my best to help lead Hololive, so please support me...

589
00:45:00,072 --> 00:45:01,272
...だけど
...but

590
00:45:01,272 --> 00:45:03,472
それからもよろしくお願いします
Please continue to support me from now on too.

591
00:45:03,472 --> 00:45:07,472
みんなのことが好きな気持ちを最後まで込めて
Pours my love for everyone into it until the very end...

592
00:45:07,472 --> 00:45:09,972
次の曲、歌います！
I will sing the next song!

593
00:45:09,972 --> 00:45:13,272
合いの手もよろしくお願いします！
Please join in with the call-and-response, too!

594
00:45:13,272 --> 00:45:17,372
はい！はい！え、ち、
Yes, yes... O-one...

595
00:45:24,472 --> 00:45:30,272
…ねえ、どうかな？似合ってる？
...Hey, what do you think? Does it look good?

596
00:45:30,272 --> 00:45:33,472
うん、綺麗だよ
Yeah, you look beautiful.

597
00:45:33,472 --> 00:45:40,472
ふふーん、ありがと！でもまさかこんな早く着れるとはな〜！
Hehe, thank you! But I never expected to wear it this soon!

598
00:45:41,072 --> 00:45:43,772
写真だけだけどね…
Though it's just for a photo...

599
00:45:44,272 --> 00:45:49,772
いやーまさかメルプロポーズされたのかと思っちゃったよ
Gosh, for a second I thought Mel was getting proposed to!

600
00:45:55,572 --> 00:45:58,772
いつか…ね
Someday... right?

601
00:45:58,772 --> 00:46:01,372
ん？なんか言った？
Hmm? Did you say something?

602
00:46:01,372 --> 00:46:04,272
いや！なんでもない
No! It's nothing.

603
00:46:04,272 --> 00:46:08,772
（やっぱりメルは深夜アニメの主人公なのかもしれない。）
(Mel really might be the protagonist of a late-night anime.)

604
00:46:08,772 --> 00:46:14,372
あ、そうだ。お礼に…これ受け取ってほしいな
Oh, right. As a thank-you... I want you to have this.

605
00:46:14,372 --> 00:46:17,472
え？これは…？
Eh? What is this...?

606
00:46:18,072 --> 00:46:22,572
これはね、代々伝わる大切な人に渡すネックレスだよ。
This is a necklace passed down through generations to be given to someone precious.

607
00:46:23,072 --> 00:46:29,872
メルとずっと一緒にいる契を結んだ者だけがつけることができるのだよ！
Only someone who has pledged to be with Mel forever is allowed to wear it!

608
00:46:29,872 --> 00:46:34,972
なにそれこわ！！！ていうか中二病感凄いんだけど！？
What's with that scary stuff?! Also, the chuunibyou vibes are off the charts!?

609
00:46:34,972 --> 00:46:41,472
うるさい！！！！ていうか！いるのいらないの！？どっち！
Shut up!!! Anyway, do you want it or not?! Which is it!

610
00:46:41,472 --> 00:46:46,472
…うん、ありがとう。ありがたく受け取らせていただきます
...Yeah, thank you. I will gladly accept it.

611
00:46:46,472 --> 00:46:50,172
よろしい。メルとおそろいだよ！
Very well. Now you match with Mel!

612
00:46:51,072 --> 00:46:59,872
これからもこんな私だけどよろしくね。大好きだよ
Please continue to support me, even though I'm like this. I love you.

613
00:46:59,872 --> 00:47:05,572
メルは少し照れながらかしこまった口調で微笑んだ。
Mel smiled with a formal tone while looking slightly embarrassed.

614
00:47:35,872 --> 00:47:39,872
誰と会ってた？って
Who were you meeting with?

615
00:47:39,872 --> 00:47:43,172
浮気した？って
Are you cheating on me?

616
00:47:43,172 --> 00:47:46,572
子供じゃないんだし
I'm not a child, you know.

617
00:47:46,572 --> 00:47:50,872
秘密くらいあるよ
Even I have some secrets.

618
00:47:50,872 --> 00:47:56,472
全部なんて見せてちゃ続かない
If I show you everything, we won't last.

619
00:47:56,472 --> 00:48:01,372
ケンカしてても
Even if we fight,

620
00:48:01,372 --> 00:48:06,672
隣り合って寝ること
sleeping side by side...

621
00:48:06,672 --> 00:48:10,872
これからの約束ね
That's our promise from now on, okay?

622
00:48:10,872 --> 00:48:12,472
返事！
Your answer!

623
00:48:12,472 --> 00:48:17,372
幾つになっても 恋させてよ あなたに
No matter how old I get, keep making me fall for you...

624
00:48:17,372 --> 00:48:22,572
格好悪いとこは 見ないようにしてあげるね
I'll try my best not to look at your uncool side, okay?

625
00:48:22,572 --> 00:48:27,472
冷めていいけど 恋していて 私に
It's okay to cool down, but keep loving me...

626
00:48:27,472 --> 00:48:32,472
綺麗だねと言われるように 頑張るからね
I'll do my best so you'll tell me, "You're beautiful."

627
00:48:42,572 --> 00:48:45,372
様々な事があった日
On days when all sorts of things happened,

628
00:48:45,372 --> 00:48:48,572
下手な料理で
With my clumsy cooking,

629
00:48:48,572 --> 00:48:53,672
笑顔をありがとう
thank you for making me smile.

630
00:48:53,672 --> 00:48:58,272
合わない趣味ばかり
We have nothing but clashing hobbies,

631
00:48:58,272 --> 00:49:01,072
もっと教えて
tell me more about them.

632
00:49:01,072 --> 00:49:03,972
こないだの続き
The continuation of what we talked about last time.

633
00:49:03,972 --> 00:49:08,872
家族増えても
Even if our family grows,

634
00:49:08,872 --> 00:49:13,972
恋人がいいの
I still want us to be lovers.

635
00:49:13,972 --> 00:49:18,072
お揃いも増やしてよ
Let's get more matching things too.

636
00:49:18,072 --> 00:49:19,472
返事！
Your answer!

637
00:49:19,472 --> 00:49:24,472
幾つになっても デートしてよ 記念日
No matter how old we get, go on dates on our anniversaries.

638
00:49:24,472 --> 00:49:29,572
プレゼントはいらない程 お洒落してね
Dress up so nice that I won't even need a present.

639
00:49:29,572 --> 00:49:34,572
晴れでもいいけど 雨の日には くっついて
Sunny days are fine, but on rainy days, let's cuddle close.

640
00:49:34,572 --> 00:49:41,572
一つの傘揺らしながら 虹を待つの
Holding a single umbrella as we walk, waiting for the rainbow.

641
00:49:41,572 --> 00:49:45,972
気付いてた？
Did you notice?

642
00:49:45,972 --> 00:49:51,272
寝てる隙に ほっぺにそっと キスしてること
That I gently kiss your cheek while you're asleep?

643
00:49:51,272 --> 00:49:56,472
気付かなかった
I didn't notice.

644
00:49:56,472 --> 00:50:00,072
寝てる隙に してくれてた
You were doing that while I was asleep...

645
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:01,880
...ダーリン ダーリン
...Darling, Darling

646
00:50:21,880 --> 00:50:26,580
しわが増えても
Even if I get more wrinkles,

647
00:50:26,880 --> 00:50:31,580
甘えたいんだよ
I still want to act spoiled.

648
00:50:31,880 --> 00:50:35,580
もちろん手もつなぐこと
And of course, we'll hold hands too.

649
00:50:35,780 --> 00:50:37,380
返事！
Answer me!

650
00:50:37,380 --> 00:50:42,180
いくつになっても飽きないでね お願い
No matter how old we get, don't grow tired of me, please.

651
00:50:42,280 --> 00:50:47,180
叱っちゃうけど頭撫でて 慰めてね
I might scold you, but pat my head and comfort me.

652
00:50:47,380 --> 00:50:52,280
いつまでもずっと恋していて 私に
Keep falling in love with me, forever and ever.

653
00:50:52,480 --> 00:50:57,580
「綺麗だね」言われるように頑張るからね
I'll do my best so you'll say, "You're beautiful."

654
00:53:07,580 --> 00:53:14,580
みんなのおかげで5周年を迎えられたよ！
[Letter: Thanks to everyone, I reached my 5th anniversary!]

655
00:53:14,580 --> 00:53:21,580
これからもたくさんの楽しい思い出つくっていこうね
[Letter: Let's continue to make lots of fun memories together!]

656
00:53:21,580 --> 00:53:28,580
Big LOVE♡だいすき！！
[Letter: Big LOVE♡ I love you so much!!]

657
00:53:28,580 --> 00:53:35,580
夜空メル
[Letter: - Yozora Mel]

658
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:15,088
みんなのおかげで5周年を迎えられたよ！
Thanks to everyone, I reached my 5th anniversary!

659
00:55:15,088 --> 00:55:30,088
これからもたくさんの楽しい思い出つくっていこうね
Let's keep making lots of fun memories together!

660
00:55:30,088 --> 00:55:45,088
Big LOVE ♡ だいすき！！
Big LOVE ♡ I love you so much!!

661
00:55:45,088 --> 00:56:00,088
メル
— Mel

